//! Native qualification for HTTP values and the single framing codec.

see ./application_response.nct
see ./body.nct
see ./codec.nct
see ./connection_input.nct
see ./connection_policy.nct
see ./field_codec.nct
see ./index.nct
see ./request.nct
see ./request_head.nct
see ./router.nct
see ./router_storage.nct
see ./response_head.nct
see ./response_plan.nct
see ./server_values.nct
see ./storage.nct
